{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/extras/Logo_Kalia_192.png?t=1744261376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Kalia, a once-promising planet, devastation is the indelible mark of a tragic past. A global catastrophe, triggered by a mysterious energy, extinguished an advanced civilization, leaving behind colossal ruins and obscure secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this desolate setting, Shaktini, a solitary and resilient miner, seeks resources to ensure her survival. Equipped with robotic implants, she ventures through the ruins of Maha Yuga Stambha, a place that holds the key to Kalia's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her journey will lead her to unravel the mysteries of the energy that destroyed the ancient civilization and to face the dangers of a hostile world. Shaktini will count on the wisdom of the sage Maharishi, who will guide her in her search for answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Kalia, time is implacable, the challenges are implacable, and the past is revealed in fragments. Shaktini will need to use all her intelligence, strength, and courage to survive and uncover the secrets of the lost civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the colossal ruins of Maha Yuga Stambha, unraveling their hidden secrets and discovering the history of the lost civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/extras/Kalia_Exploration.gif?t=1744261376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome complex obstacles and use your skills to navigate the ruins, jumping, climbing, and dodging dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/extras/Kalia_Challenge.gif?t=1744261376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve challenging puzzles that will test your intelligence and insight, opening paths to new areas and revealing crucial information about Kalia's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/extras/Kalia_Puzzles.gif?t=1744261376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a story rich in mysteries, intrigues, and complex characters, with unexpected twists and surprising revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the beauty and desolation of Kalia with detailed graphics and an immersive atmosphere.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Iniciou a Aventura","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038010/220212d0011639edfe4cb301f4e674f50b7c3bdc.jpg"},{"name":"Coletou o Kali Yantra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038010/b2a76e6c2db07d03ad49f7c45cad5d6fc4b371ad.jpg"},{"name":"Morri porque n\u00e3o sei o que \u00e9 laser.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038010/45db897c521b64d4e6d6d2b7766030be9f0b88d9.jpg"},{"name":"Desbloqueou a \u00e1rea Phekda.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038010/0d11759995ded903dbeecc936ed1ce15da03c42e.jpg"},{"name":"Me curei porque sou Loser.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038010/81e5966d23a58215563cef779af5cf671bfd1aa1.jpg"},{"name":"Pensei que podia nadar.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038010/cb15a027772c576c16f0e828aa3a011457048aed.jpg"},{"name":"Desbloqueou a \u00e1rea Alioth.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038010/2df70a7e295426345d9bba20ae45a5d30a74379e.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3038010?t=1744261376","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/26bb9ae1556c740c960920d88e0a4ccf5761f2f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744261376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/cc6ac0a85d20f0b4a45bb6443fcdf2540d05a6e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744261376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/cc6ac0a85d20f0b4a45bb6443fcdf2540d05a6e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744261376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3635590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/extras/Logo_Kalia_192.png?t=1744261376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Kalia, a once-promising planet, devastation is the indelible mark of a tragic past. A global catastrophe, triggered by a mysterious energy, extinguished an advanced civilization, leaving behind colossal ruins and obscure secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this desolate setting, Shaktini, a solitary and resilient miner, seeks resources to ensure her survival. Equipped with robotic implants, she ventures through the ruins of Maha Yuga Stambha, a place that holds the key to Kalia's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her journey will lead her to unravel the mysteries of the energy that destroyed the ancient civilization and to face the dangers of a hostile world. Shaktini will count on the wisdom of the sage Maharishi, who will guide her in her search for answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Kalia, time is implacable, the challenges are implacable, and the past is revealed in fragments. Shaktini will need to use all her intelligence, strength, and courage to survive and uncover the secrets of the lost civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the colossal ruins of Maha Yuga Stambha, unraveling their hidden secrets and discovering the history of the lost civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/extras/Kalia_Exploration.gif?t=1744261376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome complex obstacles and use your skills to navigate the ruins, jumping, climbing, and dodging dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/extras/Kalia_Challenge.gif?t=1744261376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve challenging puzzles that will test your intelligence and insight, opening paths to new areas and revealing crucial information about Kalia's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3038010/extras/Kalia_Puzzles.gif?t=1744261376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a story rich in mysteries, intrigues, and complex characters, with unexpected twists and surprising revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the beauty and desolati